OL,3,GNEWSABudget hopes for struggling
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPre Ramteke pays around #900 a month in
OL,7,Frent before bills, but says saving
OL,8,Fenough for a deposit to buy her first
OL,9,Fhome remains out of reach.
OL,11,FAfter moving to the UK from India in
OL,12,F2021, buying a home with her partner
OL,13,Fhas proved difficult, due to rising
OL,14,Fhouse prices and the cost of living.
OL,16,FHer concerns come ahead of this week's
OL,17,FBudget, when the government is expected
OL,18,Fto provide further details of its
OL,19,Fproposed Your First Home scheme, aimed
OL,20,Fat helping more first-time buyers onto
OL,21,Fthe property ladder.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
